Heh, that is a very funny post.<br><br>You are using PyBullet using GUI connection? If so, there is some intra-thread communication happening, that involves some 'waiting' between threads. Likely, the OS behaves differently during those 'waits'. Try it again using DIRECT mode, it should run faster and independent on other apps.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Thu Jan 25, 2018 5:58 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
